{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgArSyWGnXCSvYKPgrHdt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Cause:** `LegacyApp` wraps its `MaterialApp` in `PostHogWidget`, but `NewApp` doesn't. Session replay in posthog_flutter works by taking screenshots of the widget tree under that widget, so the new UI records nothing. Events and screen tracking still arrive because they come from `Analytics.init()` and `PosthogObserver`. That matches the ticket: Events show data for new-UI users but Replay is empty.\n\n**Fix:** In `lib/new_app.dart`, `MaterialApp.router` now has a `builder` that wraps its content in `PostHogWidget`. This puts the widget above the router's Navigator. `NewApp` has no `MaterialApp` child to wrap directly, so the builder is the way to do it.\n\nI haven't run it: there's no Flutter or PostHog access here. Please check on a device that a new-UI session shows up in Replay. Sessions already played on the new UI can't be recovered. Replays will show text masked, because `maskAllTexts` is on in `lib/analytics.dart`.\n\nThe explanation is in `ANSWER.md`. I made no commit."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":735,"cache_read_input_tokens":22394,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":735},"output_tokens":377,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2075540d-4f58-47fb-8414-241b15bbc1ff","uuid":"ca1c9d39-a90e-4a98-98a7-6a9957f09953","timestamp":"2026-10-19T03:03:44.078Z","request_id":"req_011CgArSyEe65juBFhY7SdC8"}
